   137	**Admissibility.** `Δ=(9,6,4)`, `n_1=n_2=3`, `3·6=18∈⟨9⟩`, `3·4=12=2·6∈⟨9,6⟩`, `4<18`, `3∤4`. Gaps of `⟨4,6,9⟩` are the six listed in §1.2. Germ `(3;23)`, `δ_∞=22`, cluster `(3^7,2,1^2)` summing to 25, `M_∞=25>24`.
   138	
   139	**Normal form.** Kill `t^8` in `p`. The coefficient of `t^{17}` in `p^2−q^3` is `−3α` with `α` the `t^5` coefficient of `q`; both surviving `(9,6)` types have `c≤4<17`, so `α=0`. Residual mixed form:
   140	
   141	```text
   142	p = t^9 + A t^7 + P6 t^6 + B t^5 + P4 t^4 + C t^3 + P2 t^2 + D t + P0
   143	q = t^6 + a t^4 + Q3 t^3 + b t^2 + Q1 t + c
