   153	
   154	**Double-point scheme.** Need six reduced off-diagonal pairs, immersive, no triple fibre. The involution `t↦−t` is *not* a symmetry once mixed terms are present, so coincident pairs are not forced. Length-6 reducedness is not desk-visible.
