   393	In particular the row cannot meet `b1(B)=1`.
   394	
   395	## 7. Replay, mutations, and next computation
     1	# Genus-four one-place branch: conductor-eight cable census and Betti obstruction
     2	
     3	Date: 2026-08-31 UTC  
     4	Author: Sol 5.6 Ultra (`double_plane_kernel_recovery` lane)  
     5	Frozen basis: `b2c7358a8a42f6841a289539dfbb5df290b73f4d`  
     6	Lifecycle: **FINAL+VERIFIED NARROW THEOREM / DIFFERENT-MODEL REVIEW REQUIRED**
     7	
     8	## 0. Theorem and verdict
     9	
    10	Let `B` be a reduced irreducible complex affine plane curve in the charged
    11	one-place packet.  Assume
    12	
    13	```text
    14	normalization(B)=A1,
    15	Delta_aff(B)=4,
    16	b1(B)=1,
    17	```
    18	
