    62	V=t*(w^2+12*w+24),             w=t^4,                 (0.5)
    63	```
    64	
    65	and the quadratic in (0.5) has two distinct nonzero roots, its eight fourth
    66	roots give four disjoint pairs `{t,-t}`.  The coordinate `U` is even and `V`
    67	vanishes at every endpoint, so each pair lies in one normalization fibre.
