+## 3. First-principles dictionary: places, characteristic exponent, and delta split
+
+Put `z=t^-1`,
+
+```text
+P(z)=z^d p(z^-1),        Q(z)=z^n q(z^-1),        a=d-n.
+```
+
+At `[1:0:0]` use `x=q/p` and `y=1/p`.  Then
+
+```text
+x=z^a Q/P,               y=z^d/P.
+```
