+```
+
+The analytic Tschirnhausen coordinate
+
+```text
+y_star=y-x^4+4*x^5-10*x^6
+```
+
+satisfies
+
+```text
+y_star=(2+3D-4e)*s^13+O(s^14)=11*s^13+O(s^14).
+```
+
+After replacing `s` by the unique uniformizer with `x=r^2`, the branch is
