+| `type86_C` | **UNFAITHFUL before computation.** Replace every raw odd coefficient and add the reduced degree-10 gap equation. |
+| `type86_D` | **UNFAITHFUL before computation.** Replace every raw odd coefficient and add reduced gap equations at degrees 10 and 4. |
