+```text
+y^3-p^2=27/1024*(8t^4+13t^2+16).
+```
+
+Hence, in the **shared constant-zero chart**,
+
+```text
+p^2-q0^3-(9/4)q0^2-(27/16)q0-27/64
+  =-27/1024*(8t^4+13t^2+16).
+```
